{
  "name": "dsh-bili-surfer",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 插件：自主刷 B 站 —— 搜索/读内容/写报告，可选自动评论并 @ 你。纯 JS，零安装。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.build.json && tsc -p tsconfig.client.json",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit",
    "selfcheck": "node selfcheck.mjs",
    "check": "pnpm run build && node selfcheck.mjs",
    "verify": "node verify.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "lib",
    "prompts",
    "src",
    "README.md",
    "AGENTS.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "//engines": "故意不写 engines.dsh —— 它是硬门槛：版本不满足时插件既不安装也不激活，只剩一句 '1 entry did not activate'。本插件没有 peerDependencies，不写这条就没有任何东西能挡住它激活。参考实现写了 >=0.1.7-rc.1，在版本不够的机器上就是静默失效。",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-plugins"
      ]
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "private": true,
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^26.6.5",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2"
  }
}
